msgstr "Uji bahwa autentikasi JWT berfungsi dengan benar"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Failed to save SSO test status"
msgstr "Gagal menyimpan status uji SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try logging in with SSO. Did it work?"
msgstr "Coba login dengan SSO. Berhasil?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "To check if JWT authentication was configured successfully, open Metabase in a different browser or in a private tab and try logging in to your account using single sign-on (SSO). Is login working correctly?"
msgstr "Untuk memeriksa apakah autentikasi JWT berhasil dikonfigurasi, buka Metabase di browser lain atau di tab privat dan coba login ke akun Anda menggunakan single sign-on (SSO). Apakah login berfungsi dengan benar?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "No, I couldn't log in"
msgstr "Tidak, saya tidak bisa login"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Log in works, I'm done"
msgstr "Login berfungsi, saya selesai"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Pemecahan masalah"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try the steps below before testing JWT authentication again. If nothing works, consider contacting support."
msgstr "Coba langkah-langkah di bawah ini sebelum menguji autentikasi JWT lagi. Jika tidak ada yang berhasil, pertimbangkan untuk menghubungi support."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "404 error after SSO sign-in"
msgstr "Error 404 setelah sign-in SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after clicking on \"Sign in with SSO\", the browser returns a 404 error, make sure the value of the JWT SSO URI in admin settings / auth / JWT is pointing to your endpoint and your endpoint is up and running and available."
msgstr "Jika setelah mengeklik \"Sign in with SSO\", browser menampilkan error 404, pastikan nilai JWT SSO URI di pengaturan admin / auth / JWT mengarah ke endpoint Anda dan endpoint Anda aktif, berjalan, dan dapat diakses."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "JWT decryption error: \"Message seems corrupt\""
msgstr "Error dekripsi JWT: \"Message seems corrupt\""

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\" there was an issue decrypting signed JWT. Ensure METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET has the right value."
msgstr "Jika setelah dialihkan dari aplikasi Anda ke Metabase, Anda melihat \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\", ada masalah saat mendekripsi JWT yang ditandatangani. Pastikan METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET memiliki nilai yang benar."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Tenant ID mismatch error"
msgstr "Error ketidakcocokan ID tenant"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", your application is trying to sign in a the user with the wrong tenant slug. Review @tenant claim in the JWT and ensure it matches the tenant this tenant user belongs to."
msgstr "Jika setelah dialihkan dari aplikasi Anda ke Metabase, Anda melihat pesan error \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", aplikasi Anda mencoba sign in pengguna dengan slug tenant yang salah. Tinjau claim @tenant di JWT dan pastikan cocok dengan tenant tempat pengguna tenant ini berada."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "User provisioning disabled for JWT SSO"
msgstr "Provisioning pengguna dinonaktifkan untuk JWT SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO."
msgstr "Jika setelah dialihkan dari aplikasi Anda ke Metabase, Anda melihat pesan error \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO.\", provisioning pengguna untuk JWT SSO sedang dimatikan di pengaturan admin/autentikasi. Aktifkan fitur ini agar pengguna diprovisikan jika belum ada, atau pastikan pengguna sudah ada sebelum men-sign in mereka via JWT SSO."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Contact customer support"
msgstr "Hubungi dukungan pelanggan"

