#: metabase/driver/settings.clj
msgid "Controls which networks Metabase may connect to for warehouse connections.\n"
"Options:\n"
"- external-only (only globally routable public addresses)\n"
"- allow-private (external + private networks but NOT loopback or link-local)\n"
"- allow-all (no restrictions).\n"
"Defaults to external-only on Metabase Cloud and allow-all when self-hosted.\n"
"Also covers the SSH tunnel host and the database auth-provider URLs."
msgstr "Mengontrol jaringan mana yang boleh dihubungi Metabase untuk koneksi warehouse.\n"
"Opsi:\n"
"- external-only (hanya alamat publik yang dapat dirutekan secara global)\n"
"- allow-private (eksternal + jaringan privat tetapi BUKAN loopback atau link-local)\n"
"- allow-all (tanpa pembatasan).\n"
"Default ke external-only di Metabase Cloud dan allow-all saat self-hosted.\n"
"Juga mencakup host SSH tunnel dan URL penyedia autentikasi database."

#: metabase/driver/settings.clj
msgid "Invalid warehouse-allowed-networks! Only values of `external-only`, `allow-private`,` and `allow-all` are allowed."
msgstr "Invalid warehouse-allowed-networks! Hanya nilai `external-only`, `allow-private`, dan `allow-all` yang diizinkan."

