msgstr "Nama model wajib diisi. Format yang diharapkan: connection/model, mis. \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model for Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, e.g. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. The connection key names an entry in the `llm-providers` setting and defaults to the provider type."
msgstr "Koneksi provider AI dan model untuk Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, mis. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. Kunci koneksi menamai sebuah entri dalam setting `llm-providers` dan default ke tipe provider."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model used for quick background tasks, such as naming Metabot conversations, in the same connection-key/model-name format as `llm-metabot-provider`. Defaults to the fastest model offered by the connection Metabot runs on."
msgstr "Koneksi provider AI dan model yang digunakan untuk tugas latar belakang cepat, seperti memberi nama percakapan Metabot, dalam format connection-key/model-name yang sama seperti `llm-metabot-provider`. Default ke model tercepat yang ditawarkan oleh koneksi yang digunakan Metabot."

